            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0001\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F005\", \"F007:F009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposal introduces a factual error in the summary by stating that the plan was in effect for a plan year beginning in 2008, whereas clause (ii)(I) explicitly requires the plan to have been in effect for a plan year beginning in 2007.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0000\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F005\", \"F007:F009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposed edit supplies the missing action and object for C0001 and accurately reflects the governing condition referenced in clause (ii), specifying that the single-employer plan must have been in effect for a plan year beginning in 2007 and had a positive balance in the funding standard account under section 1082(b) as of the end of that plan year.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"supported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
